Provides a wrapper to the ImageMagick/GraphicsMagick library; here with
ImageMagick 7 (the package libimagemagick7;
php83-imagick6 has ImageMagick 6, and the two conflict).

PECL imagick for php83 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/imagick of
the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20230831/imagick.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d.
